{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Before I can recommend a foundation, I need to know what we're building. In plain language — what is this project? What should it do for whoever uses it? (This first mission won't build the product; it stands up a running skeleton + a real test runner + one thin slice proving they're connected. Every feature you name gets recorded and deferred to its own mission.)","recommended":"Tell me the core idea in a sentence or two — e.g. 'a web app for tracking X' or 'a CLI that does Y' — and who it's for."},"prd":"# Mission: Establish foundation\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** _(pending — capturing the project vision before drafting)_\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- _(to be defined: running skeleton boots and shows something)_\n- _(to be defined: real test runner wired and watchable)_\n- _(to be defined: one thin vertical slice proving skeleton + tests are connected)_\n**Out of Scope:**\n- Building the product's features (each recorded and deferred to its own mission)\n**Constraints:**\n- _(stack to be recommended and captain-confirmed)_"}

